=800","width":800,"height":600}}}],"videos":null,"description":"Furnished 1-Bedroom Apartment with Workspace | Fürstenfeldbruck – Near Klinikum\n\nComfortable, fully furnished apartment with a separate bedroom, equipped kitchen and convenient public transport connections. Ideal for professionals, project workers and business travelers.\n\nApartment Description\n\nWelcome to your fully furnished 1-bedroom apartment at Josef-Spital-Straße 7, located in Fürstenfeldbruck, west of Munich.\n\nThis well-maintained apartment offers a practical and comfortable living environment for professionals, skilled workers, technicians and business travelers seeking accommodation for medium- or long-term stays.\n\nThe apartment features a separate private bedroom with a comfortable double bed, providing privacy and a clear separation between sleeping and everyday living areas.\n\nA compact but fully equipped kitchen allows you to prepare meals independently, while a dedicated workspace provides a convenient setting for working or studying.\n\nWhether you are relocating for work, completing a temporary assignment or working in the Munich metropolitan area, this apartment offers a comfortable and functional home.\n\nApartment Features\n\n* Separate private bedroom\n* Comfortable double bed\n* Fully furnished apartment\n* Compact, fully equipped kitchen\n* Dedicated workspace\n* Functional living space\n* Practical furniture and storage\n* Private accommodation\n* Suitable for medium- and long-term stays\n* Professionally managed by mHomes\n\nLocation & Public Transportation\n\nThe apartment is situated on Josef-Spital-Straße in Fürstenfeldbruck, a well-established town west of Munich.\n\nThe neighborhood offers convenient access to local businesses, healthcare facilities, shopping opportunities and public transportation.\n\nPublic Transport Connections\n\n* Amtsgericht / Klinikum bus stop: Approximately 2 minutes’ walk, providing convenient connections within Fürstenfeldbruck.\n* Fürstenfeldbruck S-Bahn Station (S4): Accessible by local public transportation, offering regular connections toward Munich.\n* München-Pasing: Accessible via the S4, with additional regional and long-distance rail connections.\n* Munich City Center: Connected via the S4, including München Hauptbahnhof and Marienplatz.\n\nNearby Locations & Amenities\n\n* Klinikum Fürstenfeldbruck: Conveniently located nearby, particularly suitable for hospital employees and healthcare professionals.\n* Fürstenfeldbruck Town Center: Restaurants, supermarkets, cafés, pharmacies and everyday shopping facilities.\n* Kloster Fürstenfeld: A well-known cultural landmark with surrounding recreational areas.\n* Local Business Areas: Convenient access to companies and workplaces throughout Fürstenfeldbruck and western Munich.\n\nThe location is particularly attractive for guests who work in Fürstenfeldbruck or the surrounding region while maintaining convenient transport connections to Munich.\n\nIdeal for Professionals & Business Travelers\n\nThis apartment is particularly suitable for:\n\n* Skilled workers and technicians on temporary assignments\n* Professionals working in Fürstenfeldbruck\n* Healthcare professionals and hospital employees\n* Business travelers requiring furnished accommodation\n* Employees relocating to the Munich metropolitan area\n* Interns and project-based workers\n\nThe separate bedroom provides additional privacy and comfort, making the apartment especially suitable for longer stays.\n\nWith its equipped kitchen and dedicated workspace, the property offers the independence and convenience of a private home.\n\nYour Stay with mHomes\n\nAt mHomes, we provide professionally managed, fully furnished accommodation designed for practical and comfortable everyday living.\n\nOur apartments offer functional furnishings and convenient locations, helping residents settle in and focus on their work and daily routines.\n\nA comfortable, private 1-bedroom apartment in Fürstenfeldbruck — offering the space, convenience and independence professionals need for an extended stay.","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"bathroom":{"value":"private"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"yes"},"bedrooms":{"value":"1"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"yes"},"desk":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"no"},"dryer":{"value":"no"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"flooring":{"value":"laminate"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"kitchen":{"value":"private"},"kitchenware":{"value":"private"},"pets":{"value":"discussable"},"playMusic":{"value":"discussable"},"roomFurniture":{"value":"no"},"smoking":{"value":"outside_only"},"toilet":{"value":"private"},"totalSize":{"value":"32"},"tv":{"value":"no"},"washingMachine":{"value":"yes"},"waterCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"wifi":{"value":"yes"}},"costs":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":120000,"deposit":140000,"agencyFee":0,"estimatedBills":0},"costsFormatted":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":"1200.00","deposit":"1400.00","agencyFee":"0.00","estimatedBills":"0.00"},"minimumStayMonths":3,"moveInWindow":15,"currentOccupancy":0,"minAge":18,"maxAge":40,"preferredGender":"","available":[{"to":"9999-12-31","from":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-09T00:23:04Z","__utId__":"ut1750610"},{"id":"1664551","rank":-125,"rating":0,"published":"2025-10-23","kind":1,"kindLabel":"entire place","type":1,"typeLabel":"house","rentType":"monthly","title":"Ludwig-Thoma-Straße, Fürstenfeldbruck","cancellationPolicy":"30d-movein-flexible","marketType":"rental_company","originalLink":"https://housinganywhere.com/room/ut1664551/de/Fürstenfeldbruck/ludwig-thoma-stra-e?utm_medium=affiliate&utm_source=Stayforall&affiliate_partner_id=260011&utm_content=Fürstenfeldbruck","localizedLinks":{"de":"https://housinganywhere.com/de/room/ut1664551/de/Fürstenfeldbruck/ludwig-thoma-stra-e?utm_content=Fürstenfeldb